WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.220
What are you doing!? Fire!

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.430
Yikes!

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:12.730
Alicia, are you trying to ruin this operation!?

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.070
Ah, c'mon!

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.450
- What are you doing, Alicia!?
- Whoops...

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.030
Awesome...

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.470
Alicia, don't dally around! Stay with the other two!

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.300
Those two...

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.400
Ah, feels like I've finally been set free.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.930
Really! That old hag, who does she think we are?

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.020
What are you doing?

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:43.360
Such pretty skin! Almost as white as snow, and smooth...

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:49.370
My skin is all chapped, and my muscles are awfully sore!

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:53.370
Say, Marlene, you were on Earth a long time, right?

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.370
Yeah.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:04:01.380
I'd like to go back too! If I do return, there're so many places I want to go.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:07.040
Hey, I'll take you with me. There was this real cute cake shop near my home...

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:13.390
Give it up. What's there is no longer the Earth you know. Besides...

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.720
H- hey, what are you...?

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.730
You really smell nice.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.390
Yuji doesn't stand a chance like this.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.940
But maybe it's no longer necessary...

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.730
You really looked good out there, Marlene, you and Yuji's battle drill.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:34.040
Must be nice! I wish I could pair up with Yuji the same way!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.340
That all depends on your own effort.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.470
It's all right? Really?

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:43.050
But if it were to happen, it wouldn't be fair to you, Marlene...

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.920
I know, after all.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:49.360
What are you talking about?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:54.020
It's obvious, isn't it? So, don't play dumb now.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.700
Don't tell me you don't like Yuji.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.710
I can't see any particular reason not to like him.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:04.710
Not very mild-mannered, are you? I feel sorry for Yuji.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.040
I don't get what you're saying.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.710
Oh, come on!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.940
Never mind that, Alicia, real combat is getting close.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:16.390
Don't do anything further to trip us up.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.750
Unless you'd rather die.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.530
Oh, yeah? I mean, really...!

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:38.110
Then I guess it's okay for me to entice Yuji some.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:47.280
It's different. Completely unlike I've been up to now.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:50.790
It's like as the level of our drills are raised something about me...

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:56.030
It feels like my energy is filling in more and more...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.820
Stop it!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:03.360
No! I've had it! Take me back to Earth!

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:09.600
I don't want to fight! I don't want to fight! Help me!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.370
Who could that be at this hour?

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:48.040
Tony? H- hey there, what're you up to?

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.680
You do your own maintenance checks?

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:53.280
Don't touch me!

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.890
You sure are devoted.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.360
Did you do mechanical servicing or something on Earth too?

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:10.100
Uh, look, it's just that I'm a bit interested is all.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.730
This is the first time since I woke up

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.370
that I've been able to talk to another Sleeper, same as myself.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.380
We're not the same.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:23.710
You woke up on Earth, but I was awakened here.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.590
But it still has to take you back.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:33.350
You and I must have lived on Earth during the same age and all...

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.190
I always used to go against my dad back then.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:41.830
I don't have too many good memories... But, when I was with this other guy...!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.670
What's wrong?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.340
N- nothing.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:59.680
Doesn't look like anything's amiss.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.020
I'd rather not die during just drills, you know.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.990
Everything's fine, as far as maintenance goes.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:08.690
They have the very latest facilities here.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.200
I don't trust anyone.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:16.030
There's something abnormal about the people here.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:20.470
And another thing, what you or I did in the past no longer carries any meaning at all.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:26.380
What we must think about now is...

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.640
...how it is we're going to survive here.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:44.660
How come I was reminded of him all of a sudden?

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.000
Yuji! We have emergency orders!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:49.930
What!?

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.340
Gotcha!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:59.000
What are you trying to pull?

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.880
How nice, these private quarters!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:05.010
I have three people in my room, and it's so cramped I can't stand it.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.680
Okay, what do you want?

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.020
Say, you're off right now, right?

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.350
Yeah.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.690
You know what, Yuji?

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.700
W- what?

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:19.750
I want you to come with me.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.320
You're sure working hard.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.360
Yeah...

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:05.010
How about us too?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.740
We don't get much off-duty time, and all.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:10.010
Or are you discontent with having me as your partner?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.340
No.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:12.710
Well then, it's settled!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.360
This way!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:28.400
Y- yeah...

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:06.660
Hey, Alicia, where the hell are you planning to go?

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.640
Don't worry, it's a really cool place!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:22.350
Um... I know it's around here somewhere...

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.690
Alicia!

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:29.690
This is awful! Ah! My bag!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:33.360
Aw, it's down there!

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:35.700
Say, Yuji, get it.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.700
Guess I gotta.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.360
Hold on tight, Alicia!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:44.030
Roger! Don't drop the bag, now.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:47.040
What in the world do you have in here?

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.040
It's a secret!

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.640
Oh, really?

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:14.740
Alicia! Alicia!

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.940
Alicia? Where did she go?

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.740
Alicia! Why did you let go of me!? Thanks to you, I almost died mmmf...!

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:29.410
Shh! Don't talk so loud!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.790
Why'd you suddenly do that!?

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.710
W- what's this...?

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.610
How stimulating...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.530
Enough, let's go. Give me my bag.

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:25.080
All right, what are you so excited about?

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:29.080
C'mon, hurry!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.550
Uh, yeah...

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:52.740
What is it?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.710
I don't know

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:00.710
No, it's nothing.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.300
How about one?

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:21.430
What's wrong, you're acting strange. Let's forget about all that tiresome stuff.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:26.730
I just remembered something important.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.400
S- something important?

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.100
I'm going back to my room.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.670
Are you serious?

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.340
H- hey, Marlene!

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:41.340
We really took a wrong turn. This is killing the mood!

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.360
I rather thought it was heightening the mood...

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.690
Did you say something?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.690
Uh, no...

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:51.350
What time is it now?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:54.700
Oh no, is it already this late!? This is terrible!

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.030
We have to hurry!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:59.370
Just tell me where we're going, and what about the time?

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.070
Come on, just hurry!

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:17.720
03 Block North. This is the direction Yuji and Alicia went.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.290
But... It's none of my business.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.490
Tony Frost?

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.710
I'm sure that room is...

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.680
H- hey, Alicia!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.010
Looks like we got lost somehow.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.350
This wouldn't be a restricted area, would it?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.350
Ah, there's no time!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.360
Which way should we have gone?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.690
What's that?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.020
What!? There isn't time right now!

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.460
Alicia!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.030
My precious bag!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.570
Alicia, get out of there! This way!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.040
This way, quick!

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.380
Run, Alicia!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.380
No!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.710
Run!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.720
Yuji! Yuji!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.050
Alicia, get out of here! Get out of this area!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.650
Yuji!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.400
What's this?

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:54.780
Yuji... Kaido... Alicia... Reese...

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:02.360
Mm, nice fragrance.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:06.690
It's spreading out, filling this inorganic room.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:13.030
The Hernes Citrus line. You've got good taste, Code Number 2805.

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:15.700
Marlene Angel-san.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:19.400
Tony Frost, these are the Sleeper drill records.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:21.710
Why are you looking these up?

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:23.710
I just had some concerns.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.040
Concerns?

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.020
There's not quite enough information here

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.680
for me to live with any peace of mind.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:35.020
I've investigated you as well, particularly your records from Earth.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.320
Unfortunately,

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:41.030
all the important things are locked.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:24.140
Shit, where the hell am I?

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:27.700
Alicia?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:32.680
Yuji? I am not Alicia.

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:34.650
M- Marlene.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:38.990
Ohh, I thought for sure you were Alicia.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.990
After all, that fragrance...

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:46.000
Ah, well that's... Yuji, what were you doing here?

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:50.000
What? How do you mean?

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:53.500
l- I'm not really doing anything I shouldn't be.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.340
Though I thought I'd like to...

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.000
What do you mean, nothing you shouldn't be?

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:02.670
Uh, nothing, just... Marlene, what are you doing here yourself?

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.840
I was...

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.350
Sounds like the alert has been lifted.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.920
Huh?

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.030
It's Earth.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.370
We've come all the way to the exterior here before even realizing it.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:34.000
This is probably the place where the stations used to share a junction hatch.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.410
Wow...

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.980
Light from the Earth...

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:53.620
This is a sight that happens only one time during the Station's orbit.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:13.210
I don't suppose this is what Alicia wanted to show me...

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:21.150
All I wanted was to watch it together with him...

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.230
Yuji, you idiot!

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.300
It's pretty.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:44.450
Ah, Marlene, we're being called in. We have to get going...

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.320
A little longer...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.250
I want to be here a little longer...

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:39.880
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:46.010
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:55.160
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.280 --> 00:22:01.330
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:07.750
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:14.940
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:20.100
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:26.160
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:32.440
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:39.920
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:46.780
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:54.040
This is what Tony is really capable of?

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:58.380
Unbelievable, to think that he could wipe out a Nest all by himself!

00:22:58.450 --> 00:22:59.880
I can't be outdone by him!

00:22:59.950 --> 00:23:03.280
We've both had the same training, we both pilot the same new models...

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:05.380
I should be able to do that!

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:08.080
Yeah! With the combat power of this Double Edge,

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:10.720
no matter what kind of Blue may come along...

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:13.030
I'm the same as well! I am a Sleeper!
